                <strong><a href=\"/member/PrinceofInj\">PrinceofInj</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:41:53 +08:00\">19h 22m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>阿西莫夫早就给出了方案，把基本原则直接固化到芯片中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917071\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/367b/fdbe/43850_normal.png?m=1777084318\" alt=\"ddter\" data-uid=\"43850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ddter\">ddter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:48:20 +08:00\">19h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>卷不动了，看最近的几次 ops4.8 ops5 都没有太大的变化反而还有退步。我感觉撞到瓶颈了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917135\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/52e6/5864/442967_normal.png?m=1571234314\" alt=\"PopRain\" data-uid=\"442967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PopRain\">PopRain</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 15:59:01 +08:00\">19h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>A/要上市，先把竞争对手搞掉，否则没有办法画饼呀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917243\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca75047672c323e2c0b1f4b4846c926a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"champaulmmc\" data-uid=\"624336\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/champaulmmc\">champaulmmc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:16:21 +08:00\">18h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 今年发布 5.3 5.4 5.5 5.6 这才是上半年,opus 也是 4.6 4.7 4.8 fable5 ，速度快到模糊，qwen 也是 3.5 3.6 3.7 现在 3.8,三个月发布两款新旗舰。现在模型从训练结果到训练过程，就是 AI 需要能够知道过程怎么操作，这个原始数据太难采集了,为了 ai 隐私问题将会大爆发，我们的开源模型的安全将会被国内一众捧上神坛。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917303\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/722a/0888/383858_normal.png?m=1607073229\" alt=\"hereIsChen\" data-uid=\"383858\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hereIsChen\">hereIsChen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:26:14 +08:00\">18h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>发达国家呼吁环保，让发展中国家不要发展，节能减排，交碳税</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917484\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e0dca552efc8a528ae74712dfa476be9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"rel\" data-uid=\"224055\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rel\">rel</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:52:43 +08:00\">18h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>他们越这样，你越兴奋就对了~</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917491\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1de4265471582607d796903997063772?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wu00\" data-uid=\"568801\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wu00\">wu00</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:53:25 +08:00\">18h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>资本出手了呗  <br>就跟前几个月公司大力支持员工消耗 token 一样，这几个月账单拉出来一看，喔尼玛，赶紧限流</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917521\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 16:58:15 +08:00\">18h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>停留在现在的水平对大家都好，既不会产生太多安全风险，又能保住很多人的饭碗，生产力相对前几年也有巨大的飞跃。但是，没法执行啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17917550\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/294cd0730bbe0a07457c84f88c881a32?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Leon777\" data-uid=\"682673\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Leon777\">Leon777</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 17:01:33 +08:00\">18h 3m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>互相卷算力几千亿的投是一边心疼一边怕掉队谁也不敢停</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918192\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a5b3aee0373a798d8008d57677feac6c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JackeyLee233\" data-uid=\"788851\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JackeyLee233\">JackeyLee233</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 20:09:30 +08:00\">14h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看什么角度想了<br>正面角度：这些顶级 ai 机构都看到了 ai 的危险性 处于对人类文明的考虑所以联手发起倡议<br>负面角度：单纯就是被中国开源 ai 搞得受不了了 毕竟断人财路犹如杀人父母 所以想把老美政府拉下水来狠狠制裁</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918199\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/50d4/5ea2/477585_normal.png?m=1780413510\" alt=\"imhuhe\" data-uid=\"477585\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>45</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imhuhe\">imhuhe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 20:11:43 +08:00\">14h 53m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>哪儿来的臭毛病，沾不到就是“如何看待”，比 AI 灌水还臭。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918206\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7e2bf922cd1549f93c11c5c00158eb57?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Yadomin\" data-uid=\"497842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yadomin\">Yadomin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 20:16:32 +08:00\">14h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>市面要是真的这你三家那还有意义，但问题是现在国产模型不仅追的快还开源，你停下来不是等于自杀？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918302\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6191/42f4/435565_normal.png?m=1754115290\" alt=\"restkhz\" data-uid=\"435565\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>48</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/restkhz\">restkhz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 21:20:23 +08:00\">13h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>鉴于最近的一些网络安全事件，大概可以理解。</p><p>其实从一开始就一直在讨论 AI 安全问题，当时他们还搞了个伦理与安全委员会，OpenAI 成立当初也是为了不能让这种技术掌握在少数人手里，只不过最后都变质了。</p><p>我也不觉得这种呼吁和限制中国模型发展有多大关系，毕竟算力已经卡的够死了。如果真是为了限制，还不如这三家联合搞点新闻跳个脚，让美国政府继续对中国施压。呼吁？真的有用吗？</p><p>Mythos 和最近 hf 的事情先不说真假，去年的 opus-4 已经能独立解出一个 VM opcode 混淆逆向的 CTF 题目。<br>我这本地跑一个 Qwen3.6-27B 它也晓得用 nmap,用 nuclei ，一路字典爆破顺便搞搞漏洞 exp.初级 CTF 逆向题和 pwn 它也完全能做到，能逆向分析恶意软件并且给函数重命名辅助逆向。我完全相信比它大百倍的模型有更恐怖的能力。</p><p>搞不好今年年底就有哪个中国公司开放权重一个百来 b 参数，能力接近 Mythos 的模型，还被人 abliterated ，直接武器化...</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918328\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d1f2/b9b4/64727_normal.png?m=1784360797\" alt=\"isbase\" data-uid=\"64727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>49</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/isbase\">isbase</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 21:34:08 +08:00\">13h 30m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>他的意思是说，忽悠别人放慢速度，这样自己才有机会赶上呀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918553\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9239/6e05/251820_normal.png?m=1727356929\" alt=\"fcoo\" data-uid=\"251820\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fcoo\">fcoo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 01:19:02 +08:00\">9h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就好比是班上学习好的同学看到差生也疯狂努力，成绩越来越好，有点慌了，于是号召大家都出去玩吧，放松一下，然后自己偷偷学</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918609\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/59c2cfa957273b872c9f2f098e618b2c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Planarians\" data-uid=\"246723\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>52</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Planarians\">Planarians</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 04:43:15 +08:00\">6h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>高情商：放慢研究 ai<br>低情商：发现快到边际效应了 投入回报比越来越低了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918677\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/803f/25db/109311_normal.png?m=1755309123\" alt=\"VeteranCat\" data-uid=\"109311\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VeteranCat\">VeteranCat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 08:07:54 +08:00\">2h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>让 KIMI DeepSeek 给吓着了，我™这么限制你了你怎么还能这样？  大概是这种感觉。</p><p>实际上 token 价格以他们目前的玩法，成本是下不来的，价格也是下不来的，投入和产出是不成正比的。</p><p>AI 目前最佳的玩法还是工业 AI ，垂直应用，而不是泛用型 AI 打造。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918686\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/77eccb46ea9752f9f7414a479f2d056b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"johnwonderful\" data-uid=\"671159\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>54</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/johnwonderful\">johnwonderful</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 08:17:48 +08:00\">2h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这些大企业实在是吃相难看，一点领军企业的魅力都没有，还搞这种上车想焊死车门的事情</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918688\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2124c8aba1b20643d71a5101a519a80d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zerovoid\" data-uid=\"263784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>55</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zerovoid\">zerovoid</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 08:20:05 +08:00\">2h 44m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>就跟欧美工业发展到一定程度之后开始抓环保，<br>关键不仅抓自己的，还要抓亚非拉这种后进国的，</p><p>碳，我排爽了，你们就别排了，问就是为了保护地球。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918778\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a4dc/1548/30216_normal.png?m=1749378470\" alt=\"gogozs\" data-uid=\"30216\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gogozs\">gogozs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 08:50:05 +08:00\">2h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>泡沫破的速度快，利益受损了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918900\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eba2/37ec/7875_normal.png?m=1758683454\" alt=\"MoliOOO\" data-uid=\"7875\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>58</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoliOOO\">MoliOOO</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 09:14:07 +08:00\">1h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前马斯克不也搞过吗？ OpenAI 停下他前进的脚步，等一等他的同行了吗？<br>🤣👉🤡</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919143\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b82/0e11/623492_normal.png?m=1760924761\" alt=\"youzhiqing\" data-uid=\"623492\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/youzhiqing\">youzhiqing</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 09:40:56 +08:00\">1h 23m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在的 ai 新闻每一段时间就要吹捧一下，但是 ai 依旧不能主动思考和长期记忆</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919504\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cbc6/af77/647143_normal.png?m=1749696157\" alt=\"JDSN\" data-uid=\"647143\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>67</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JDSN\">JDSN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:24:00 +08:00\">40 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>天方夜谭啊，为什么疯狂的研究那？谁都怕掉队，就不可能停下来，未来已来，已无法制止。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17919736\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e67c/f0f1/221717_normal.png?m=1780382101\" alt=\"Topmax\" data-uid=\"221717\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>68</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Topmax\">Topmax</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 10:51:08 +08:00\">13 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>影响到我上市了，那我就掐死你</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"是真的有危机。 还是跟原子弹一样，“我有了，你就别有了” AI 科技 竞争69 replies • 2026-07-30 11:00:38 +08:00 1 bush911 23h 22m ago via Android 17 我有了，你就别有了 2 TomatoCLI 23h 21m ago 估计又到了一个瓶颈期，后面的追上来了的话，本来又没有护城河，用户说换就换。 3 Rickkkkkkk 23h 19m ago 其实角度都是安全，我让 chatgpt 写个绕开一些网站的付费墙的 chrome 扩展都被拒绝了。 4 nsjs 23h 19m ago via iPhon